    'help.good': 'Good to know',
    'help.g.mistake': 'Wrong key? Ctrl+Z right away. Later: in Record, \u201cFix a step\u201d lists the step in progress and the 4 before it, with Change and Delete. You can also click the current step under the video, or long press a step on the band (right-click on a computer). The Delete key deletes the step in progress.',
